#: src/face-unlock:50
msgid ""
"Face unlock's service has to be switched on once for this computer. That "
"needs your password."
msgstr "人脸解锁服务需要在这台电脑上开启一次。这需要你的密码。"

#: src/face-unlock:57
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Check it with: systemctl status %s"
msgstr "用以下命令检查：systemctl status %s"

#: src/face-unlock:67
msgid ""
"Setting up a face needs the camera picture on screen. Run this inside your "
"desktop session."
msgstr "设置人脸需要在屏幕上显示摄像头画面。请在你的桌面会话中运行。"

#: src/face-unlock:71
msgid "The setup window is open. Follow it there."
msgstr "设置窗口已打开。请按窗口中的步骤操作。"

#: src/face-unlock:80
msgid "The face is set up."
msgstr "人脸已设置。"

#: src/face-unlock:83
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Face unlock is still off. Turn it on with [1] or `%s enable`."
msgstr "人脸解锁仍处于关闭状态。用 [1] 或 `%s enable` 开启。"

#: src/face-unlock:87
msgid "No face was added."
msgstr "没有添加人脸。"

#: src/face-unlock:96
msgid "First, set up your face."
msgstr "请先设置你的人脸。"

#: src/face-unlock:100 src/face-unlock:121 src/lib/menu.sh:446
#: src/lib/menu.sh:450 src/lib/menu.sh:456 src/lib/menu.sh:458
msgid "Could not save the setting."
msgstr "无法保存设置。"

#: src/face-unlock:104
msgid "Could not start the lock screen agent."
msgstr "无法启动锁屏代理。"

#: src/face-unlock:107
msgid "No systemd user session, so the lock screen agent was not started."
msgstr "没有 systemd 用户会话，因此未启动锁屏代理。"

#: src/face-unlock:114
msgid "Face unlock is on. Lock the screen and look at it to try."
msgstr "人脸解锁已开启。锁定屏幕并看着它来试试。"

#: src/face-unlock:116
msgid "It can do sudo and admin prompts too. See Settings."
msgstr "它也可以用于 sudo 和管理员授权。见“设置”。"

#: src/face-unlock:131
msgid "Face unlock is off. Your faces are kept; delete them under Faces."
msgstr "人脸解锁已关闭。你的人脸会保留；可在“人脸”中删除。"

#: src/face-unlock:145 src/lib/daemon.sh:109
msgid "No face is set up yet."
msgstr "尚未设置任何人脸。"

#: src/face-unlock:149 src/lib/menu.sh:180 src/lib/menu.sh:608
msgid "on"
msgstr "开"

#: src/face-unlock:149 src/lib/menu.sh:182 src/lib/menu.sh:192
#: src/lib/menu.sh:609
msgid "off"
msgstr "关"

#: src/face-unlock:151 src/lib/menu.sh:626
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "%s samples, %s learned"
msgstr "%s 个样本，已学习 %s 个"

#: src/face-unlock:157
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Which face? See `%s faces` for the ids."
msgstr "哪张人脸？用 `%s faces` 查看 ID。"

#: src/face-unlock:161
msgid "Deleted."
msgstr "已删除。"

#: src/face-unlock:172
msgid "Usage: face-unlock [command]"
msgstr "用法：face-unlock [命令]"

#: src/face-unlock:174
msgid "Commands:"
msgstr "命令："

#: src/face-unlock:175
msgid "Turn face unlock on"
msgstr "开启人脸解锁"

#: src/face-unlock:176
msgid "Turn it off (faces are kept)"
msgstr "关闭（保留人脸）"

#: src/face-unlock:177 src/lib/menu.sh:692
msgid "Add a face"
msgstr "添加人脸"

#: src/face-unlock:178
msgid "List the faces"
msgstr "列出人脸"

#: src/face-unlock:179
msgid "Delete a face"
msgstr "删除人脸"

#: src/face-unlock:180
msgid "Look at the camera and see what it sees"
msgstr "看着摄像头，查看它看到的画面"

#: src/face-unlock:181
msgid "Show what is on"
msgstr "显示已开启的功能"

#: src/face-unlock:182
msgid "Show this help"
msgstr "显示此帮助"

#: src/face-unlock:183
msgid "Show the version"
msgstr "显示版本"

#: src/face-unlock:185
msgid "Without a command an interactive menu is shown."
msgstr "不带命令时显示交互式菜单。"

#: src/face-unlock:204
msgid ""
"Run this as your own user, not as root. It asks for your password when it "
"needs to."
msgstr "请以你自己的用户运行，不要用 root。需要时会询问你的密码。"

#: src/face-unlock:222 src/lib/system.sh:89
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Unknown command: %s"
msgstr "未知命令：%s"

#: src/lib/common.sh:169
msgid "never"
msgstr "从未"

#: src/lib/common.sh:179
msgid "just now"
msgstr "刚刚"

#: src/lib/common.sh:181
msgid "1 minute ago"
msgstr "1 分钟前"

#: src/lib/common.sh:184
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "%d minutes ago"
msgstr "%d 分钟前"

#: src/lib/common.sh:186
msgid "1 hour ago"
msgstr "1 小时前"

#: src/lib/common.sh:189
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "%d hours ago"
msgstr "%d 小时前"

#: src/lib/common.sh:191
msgid "1 day ago"
msgstr "1 天前"

#: src/lib/common.sh:194
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "%d days ago"
msgstr "%d 天前"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:102
msgid "The face did not match."
msgstr "人脸不匹配。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:103
msgid "That looked like a photo or a screen."
msgstr "看起来像照片或屏幕。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:104
msgid "The face matched, but did not blink or move."
msgstr "人脸匹配，但没有眨眼或移动。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:105
msgid "The face was not looking at the screen."
msgstr "人脸没有看着屏幕。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:106
msgid "The picture was too dark, too blurry or too far away."
msgstr "画面太暗、太模糊或太远。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:107
msgid "No face in view."
msgstr "画面中没有人脸。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:108
msgid ""
"Face unlock is paused after too many tries. Unlock once with your password."
msgstr "尝试次数过多，人脸解锁已暂停。请用密码解锁一次。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:110
msgid "The camera could not be used."
msgstr "无法使用摄像头。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:111 src/lib/menu.sh:262
msgid "The recognition models are missing. Reinstall the package."
msgstr "缺少识别模型。请重新安装软件包。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:112
msgid "The lid is closed."
msgstr "笔记本盖子已合上。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:113
msgid "The camera is busy with another scan."
msgstr "摄像头正忙于另一次扫描。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:114
msgid "The face unlock service is not running."
msgstr "人脸解锁服务未运行。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:115
msgid "Not allowed."
msgstr "不允许。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:116
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Something went wrong (%s)."
msgstr "出错了（%s）。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:127
msgid "Look at the camera. Blink once, or turn your head a little."
msgstr "看着摄像头。眨一下眼，或稍微转一下头。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:137
msgid "Face found."
msgstr "找到人脸。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:141
msgid "Recognised. Now blink once, or turn your head a little."
msgstr "已识别。现在眨一下眼，或稍微转一下头。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:142
msgid "Look at the screen."
msgstr "请看屏幕。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:143
msgid "Move closer to the camera."
msgstr "请靠近摄像头。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:144
msgid "It is too dark to see your face."
msgstr "太暗了，看不清你的脸。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:153
msgid "match"
msgstr "匹配度"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:153
msgid "turn"
msgstr "转动"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:154
msgid "eyes"
msgstr "眼睛"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:155
msgid "depth"
msgstr "深度"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:155 src/lib/daemon.sh:164
msgid "blink"
msgstr "眨眼"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:156
msgid "glare"
msgstr "反光"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:156
msgid "edge"
msgstr "边缘"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:165
msgid "head turn"
msgstr "转头"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:167
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Recognised as %s (match %s) in %s ms."
msgstr "识别为 %s（匹配度 %s），用时 %s 毫秒。"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:168
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Sign of life: %s"
msgstr "活体迹象：%s"

#: src/lib/daemon.sh:173
msgid ""
"That was too many tries. Face unlock is paused until you unlock with your "
"password."
msgstr "尝试次数过多。人脸解锁已暂停，直到你用密码解锁。"

#. TRANSLATORS: the letter after "[" is the key for yes. y works too.
#: src/lib/menu.sh:141
msgid "[y/N]"
msgstr "[y/N]"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:172 src/lib/menu.sh:509
msgid "ON"
msgstr "开启"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:174 src/lib/menu.sh:510
msgid "OFF"
msgstr "关闭"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:190 src/lib/menu.sh:194
msgid "strict"
msgstr "严格"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:191
msgid "basic"
msgstr "基础"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:193 src/lib/menu.sh:198
msgid "normal"
msgstr "正常"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:195
msgid "relaxed"
msgstr "宽松"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:196
msgid "island with the face"
msgstr "带人脸的岛"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:197
msgid "small pill with a lock"
msgstr "带锁的小药丸"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:199
msgid "fast"
msgstr "快"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:200
msgid "slow"
msgstr "慢"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:201
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "%s seconds"
msgstr "%s 秒"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:202 src/lib/menu.sh:421
msgid "automatic"
msgstr "自动"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:219
msgid "Face unlock"
msgstr "人脸解锁"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:223
msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:223
msgid "not running"
msgstr "未运行"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:225
msgid "Turning face unlock on again starts it."
msgstr "重新开启人脸解锁即可启动它。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:236 src/lib/menu.sh:238 src/lib/menu.sh:604
#: src/lib/menu.sh:693
msgid "Faces"
msgstr "人脸"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:236
msgid "none set up yet"
msgstr "尚未设置"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:238
msgid "all turned off"
msgstr "全部关闭"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:244
msgid "none found"
msgstr "未找到"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:246 src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "摄像头"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:248 src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Lock screen"
msgstr "锁屏"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:252
msgid "sudo"
msgstr "sudo"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:253 src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Admin prompts"
msgstr "管理员授权"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:254 src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Photo check"
msgstr "照片检测"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:257
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "已暂停"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:257
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "for %d more minutes, or until the password is used"
msgstr "还有 %d 分钟，或直到使用密码"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:259
msgid "Last unlock"
msgstr "上次解锁"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:265
msgid "The lock screen agent is not running."
msgstr "锁屏代理没有运行。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:308
msgid ""
"GNOME does not let other programs show above its windows, so there is no "
"bubble on GNOME."
msgstr "GNOME 不允许其他程序显示在它的窗口之上，所以 GNOME 上没有气泡。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:312
msgid ""
"Unlocks the lock screen when it sees your face. Off: only your password "
"works there."
msgstr "看到你的脸时解锁锁屏。关闭：锁屏只能用密码。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:313
msgid ""
"Scans when you press a key or move the mouse on the lock screen, and when "
"the computer wakes up."
msgstr "在锁屏上按键或移动鼠标时，以及电脑唤醒时扫描。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:314
msgid ""
"Scans as soon as the screen locks. Off by default: if you lock it yourself, "
"it would unlock again right away."
msgstr "屏幕一锁定就扫描。默认关闭：如果是你自己锁的屏，它会马上又解锁。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:315
msgid ""
"sudo takes your face instead of the password. No match: you type the "
"password as usual."
msgstr "sudo 用你的脸代替密码。不匹配时，照常输入密码。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:316
msgid ""
"The password windows of your desktop and apps, for example when you install "
"software. No match: you type the password."
msgstr "桌面和应用的密码窗口，例如安装软件时。不匹配时，输入密码即可。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:317
msgid ""
"You have to blink or turn your head a little. This also stops printed photos."
msgstr "你需要眨眼或稍微转头。这也能挡住打印的照片。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:318
msgid "No check at all. Only for trying out a camera."
msgstr "完全不检测。仅用于试用摄像头。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:319
msgid ""
"Stops photos on a phone, a tablet or glossy paper. You do not have to blink. "
"A matte printed photo can get through."
msgstr "挡住手机、平板或光面纸上的照片。无需眨眼。哑光纸打印的照片可能会通过。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:320
msgid ""
"Fewer wrong matches, but it may not know you with glasses or in bad light."
msgstr "误认更少，但戴眼镜或光线不好时可能认不出你。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:321
msgid "Knows you more easily, but also somebody who looks a lot like you."
msgstr "更容易认出你，但也更容易认出和你长得很像的人。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:322
msgid "The default. Right for most people."
msgstr "默认值。适合大多数人。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:323
msgid ""
"Your eyes have to be open and on the screen. So it does not unlock while you "
"look away or sleep."
msgstr "你的眼睛必须睁开并看着屏幕。这样你看向别处或睡着时不会解锁。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:324
msgid ""
"Automatic takes the first normal camera. After a change, set up your face "
"again. An infrared camera needs its light on (linux-enable-ir-emitter)."
msgstr ""
"“自动”会使用第一个普通摄像头。更换后请重新设置人脸。红外摄像头需要打开它的补"
"光灯（linux-enable-ir-emitter）。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:325
msgid "How long the camera looks for your face before it gives up."
msgstr "摄像头寻找你的脸多久后放弃。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:326
msgid ""
"After a sure match it keeps how you look now. So a new haircut or glasses "
"need no new setup."
msgstr "确定匹配后，会记住你现在的样子。所以换了发型或戴上眼镜也无需重新设置。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:327
msgid ""
"No scan while the laptop is closed, for example at a desk with an external "
"screen."
msgstr "笔记本合上时不扫描，例如在接了外接显示器的桌前。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:328
msgid "The bubble at the top of the screen shows what the camera is doing."
msgstr "屏幕顶部的气泡显示摄像头正在做什么。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:329
msgid "A small pill with a lock that opens."
msgstr "一个带锁的小药丸，锁会打开。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:330
msgid "An island with a face that looks around, then rings and a tick."
msgstr "一个岛，里面有一张四处张望的脸，然后是圆环和一个对勾。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:331
msgid "How fast the bubble moves."
msgstr "气泡移动的速度。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:332
msgid "Shows the bubble when sudo or an admin prompt scans your face, too."
msgstr "sudo 或管理员授权扫描你的脸时也显示气泡。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:417
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "automatic (%s)"
msgstr "自动（%s）"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:427
msgid "(infrared)"
msgstr "（红外）"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:431
msgid "(not connected)"
msgstr "（未连接）"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:506 src/lib/menu.sh:694
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:507
msgid "↑↓ select   ←→ or Space: change   q: back"
msgstr "↑↓ 选择   ←→ 或空格：更改   q：返回"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:508
msgid "for all users, asks for your password"
msgstr "对所有用户生效，需要你的密码"

#. TRANSLATORS: keep the letters, they are the keys.
#: src/lib/menu.sh:606
msgid "Up/Down: select, Space: on/off, r: rename, d: delete, a: add, q: back"
msgstr "上/下：选择，空格：开/关，r：重命名，d：删除，a：添加，q：返回"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:607
msgid "No face is set up yet. Press a to add one."
msgstr "尚未设置任何人脸。按 a 添加。"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:653
msgid "New name:"
msgstr "新名称："

#: src/lib/menu.sh:660
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Delete \"%s\"?"
msgstr "删除“%s”？"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:691
msgid "Turn face unlock on or off"
msgstr "开启或关闭人脸解锁"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:695
msgid "Try it"
msgstr "试一试"

#: src/lib/menu.sh:696
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "退出"

#: src/lib/pam.sh:132
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "The PAM module is not installed at %s."
msgstr "PAM 模块未安装在 %s。"

#: src/lib/pam.sh:140
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "There is no PAM configuration for %s on this system."
msgstr "此系统上没有 %s 的 PAM 配置。"

#: src/lib/system.sh:47
msgid "This needs root, and neither sudo, run0 nor doas is installed."
msgstr "这需要 root 权限，但 sudo、run0 和 doas 都没有安装。"

#: src/lib/system.sh:56
msgid "This command has to run as root."
msgstr "此命令必须以 root 运行。"

#: src/lib/system.sh:64
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Not a valid setting: %s=%s"
msgstr "无效的设置：%s=%s"

#: src/lib/system.sh:75
#, sh-printf-format
msgid "Not a service this can be used for: %s"
msgstr "不能用于此服务：%s"

#: src/lib/system.sh:131
#, sh-printf-format
msgid ""
"Hyprland does not start the lock screen agent by itself. Add this line to %s:"
msgstr "Hyprland 不会自动启动锁屏代理。请把这一行加入 %s："

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Unlock with your face"
msgstr "用人脸解锁"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Scan when you come back"
msgstr "你回来时扫描"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Scan right after locking"
msgstr "锁定后立即扫描"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Password prompts"
msgstr "密码提示"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "sudo in a terminal"
msgstr "终端中的 sudo"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Recognition"
msgstr "识别"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "How closely the face has to match"
msgstr "匹配的严格程度"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Only when you look at the screen"
msgstr "仅在你看着屏幕时"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "How long a scan lasts"
msgstr "每次扫描的时长"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Learn from every unlock"
msgstr "每次解锁时学习"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Not when the lid is closed"
msgstr "合上盖子时不扫描"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Bubble"
msgstr "气泡"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Show the bubble"
msgstr "显示气泡"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Animation speed"
msgstr "动画速度"

#: src/lib/menu.sh
msgid "Also for sudo and admin prompts"
msgstr "sudo 和管理员授权时也显示"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:98
msgid "Blink once"
msgstr "眨一下眼"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:100
msgid "Look at the screen"
msgstr "请看屏幕"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:102
msgid "Move closer"
msgstr "靠近一点"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:104
msgid "Too dark"
msgstr "太暗了"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:124
msgid "Use your password"
msgstr "请使用密码"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:130
msgid "Not recognized"
msgstr "未识别"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:132
msgid "Try again and blink"
msgstr "再试一次并眨眼"

#: src/agent/bubblecontroller.cpp:134
msgid "Camera unavailable"
msgstr "摄像头不可用"

#: src/agent/enrollcontroller.cpp:68
msgid "Bring your face into the circle."
msgstr "把你的脸放进圆圈里。"

#: src/agent/enrollcontroller.cpp:70
msgid "Only one face, please."
msgstr "请只出现一张脸。"

#: src/agent/enrollcontroller.cpp:72
msgid "Move a little closer."
msgstr "再靠近一点。"

#: src/agent/enrollcontroller.cpp:74
msgid "It is too dark. Turn on a light."
msgstr "太暗了。请开灯。"

#: src/agent/enrollcontroller.cpp:76
